## 7. Error Handling Extensions in `crates/flightreader-core/src/error.rs`

### 7.1 Audit of Existing Variants (Phase 1)
| Existing Variant | Current Usage | Milestone 1 Applicability |
|---|---|---|
| `CorruptedHeader` | Negative `details_offset` | Header validation |
| `InvalidHeaderLength { length: i16 }` | Header length != 100 and != 101 | Header validation |
| `UnsupportedVersion { version: u8 }` | Version not in 1..=14 | Header & capabilities |
| `TruncatedRecord { expected: usize, available: usize }` | Frame/record too short | **Directly used in `RawRecordEnvelope::parse`** |
| `InvalidRecordDelimiter { found: u8 }` | Trailing delimiter != 0xFF | **Directly used in `RawRecordEnvelope::parse`** |
| `PayloadTooShort { minimum: usize, available: usize }` | Crypto slice too small | Phase 1 XOR / Phase 2 decoders |
| `BufferOverflow { required: usize, capacity: usize }` | Out buffer too small | Phase 1 XOR / Phase 2 decoders |
| `SyncNotFound` | .DAT magic 0x55 missing | .DAT framing |
| `ChecksumMismatch { expected, calculated }` | .DAT CRC mismatch | .DAT framing |
| `InvalidFrameLength { length, minimum }` | .DAT length < 11 | .DAT framing |
| `UnexpectedEof` | Slice shorter than header | **Directly used in envelope parsing** |

### 7.2 New Variants Needed for Phase 2
To support M1 dependencies, M3 AES decryption, M4 geodetic conversion, and M2/M5 telemetry decoders:

