*Note on `Eq` Trait*: Because `CoordinatesOutOfBounds` contains `f64` values, `f64` does not implement `Eq` due to IEEE 754 NaN semantics. `FlightReaderError` should derive `#[derive(Error, Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]`. The existing tests only assert equality using `PartialEq`.

